 (for example: screen 1080x2220 and typical video 16:9 is rendering like 1080x608 and other area is just black). It's necessary to have such a big texture to be able make animated transitions/scales/crops/etc from one screen to another.\r\n2. If SubtitleView measured like 1080x2220 then we have a huge size of text and it's not I'am expect.\r\n    If it is measured to video frame size 1080x608 and located in screen center over video then there's a bug when cues rendered somewhere bottom outside subtitle's view. ","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/419436522/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"komissarovdenis","id":6702649,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDI2NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6702649?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/komissarovdenis","html_url":"https://github.com/komissarovdenis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/komissarovdenis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/komissarovdenis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/komissarovdenis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/komissarovdenis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/komissarovdenis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/komissarovdenis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/komissarovdenis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/komissarovdenis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/komissarovdenis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/419441085","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/4788#issuecomment-419441085","issue_url":"h